      "summary": "Total Importance serves as the primary objective function for profit.",
      "explanation": "In the VRP with Profit problem, profit is expressed as Total Importance (R2931). This Total Importance is derived by summing the individual Importance values of all nodes contained within a given path P (R2425), where Importance is assigned via an Importance Function (R3654)."
